msgid "Hit \"Generate & Copy\" button to generate embed code. It will be copied to your Clipboard. You can now paste this embed code inside your website's HTML where you want to show the List."
msgstr "Hit \"Generate &amp; Copy\" button to generate embed code. It will be copied to your Clipboard. You can now paste this embed code inside your website's HTML where you want to show the List."

msgid "<a href=\"%1$s\">Please update WordPress</a>, and then <a href=\"%2$s\">learn more about updating PHP</a>."
msgstr "<a href=\"%1$s\">Please update WordPress</a>, and then <a href=\"%2$s\">learn more about updating PHP</a>."

